OL,3,GNEWSAChip shop looks to future as it
OL,4,Amarks 50 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a fish and chip shop that
OL,7,Fhas just celebrated 50 years of
OL,8,Fbusiness has said rising bills and
OL,9,Fcompetition meant there had never been
OL,10,Fa tougher environment for takeaways.
OL,12,FHarry Haralambous took over Salop Fish
OL,13,FBar in Oswestry from his father, Peter,
OL,14,F30 years ago and said a lot had changed
OL,15,Fsince it first opened in 1976.
OL,17,FAt its peak, his father sold two tonnes
OL,18,Fof chips a week, compared with half a
OL,19,Ftonne now.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
