OL,3,GNEWSAChip shop looks to future as it
OL,4,Amarks 50 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnergy bills have gone up in recent
OL,7,Fyears, while the war in Ukraine has hit
OL,8,Fthe price of fish, and now farmers are
OL,9,Fwarning that the Iran war is likely to
OL,10,Fincrease the price of potatoes.
